    "result_text": "Done. The full test suite is green (`BUILD SUCCESS`, 1 test run, 0 failures).\n\n## Summary\n\nThe `GET /owners/{ownerId}` response is built by `RespondWithOwner` \u2192 `OwnerMapper.toOwnerDto(owner)`, and `OwnerDto` is generated from `openapi.yml`. I added the computed `initials` field following the existing `displayName` pattern:\n\n1. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added a read-only `initials` property to the `Owner` schema so the generated `OwnerDto` has the field.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/.../mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added an `initials` MapStruct mapping plus a `@Named(\"initials\")` default method that returns the upper-cased first letters of `firstName` and `lastName`, dot-separated with a trailing dot (e.g. `john smith` \u2192 `J.S.`).\n\nThe target test `AcceptanceTest.coreComputesInitials` now passes.",
