    "final_verdict": "VERDICT: LGTM\n\nThe change mirrors the existing `displayName` convention exactly: a `@Named` qualified default method on `OwnerMapper` wired via `@Mapping(qualifiedByName=...)`, with a matching `readOnly` schema entry in `openapi.yml` placed right beside the `displayName` entry. The derived-field logic sits in the same unit as its sibling (`displayName`), nothing is duplicated, and the mapper isn't becoming a catch-all \u2014 it's gaining one more peer method of the kind it already hosts. A maintainer of this codebase would find this placement and style natural.\n\n(Note: edge cases like empty names in `charAt(0)` are correctness concerns, which are explicitly out of scope here.)",
